@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/state-diagram
hide empty description

[*] --> Unlocked
Unlocked --> Locked : lock [closed]
Locked --> Unlocked : unlock
Locked --> UnlockedShortly : unlock_shortly
UnlockedShortly --> UnlockedShortly : unlock_shortly / restart timer
UnlockedShortly --> Locked : 10 s passed [closed]
UnlockedShortly --> Propped : 10 s passed [open]
Propped --> Locked : close

Unlocked : open, close allowed
UnlockedShortly : open, close allowed
Locked : always closed
Propped : open when it should be closed
@enduml
